Source: nvidia-graphics-drivers-legacy
Section: non-free/x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Randall Donald <rdonald@debian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>> 4.0.0), sed (>> 3.0)
Standards-Version: 3.6.2


Package: nvidia-glx-legacy-ia32
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nvidia-kernel-legacy-#VERSION#, ia32-libs, ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: nvidia-settings, nvidia-kernel-legacy-source (>= #VERSION#)
Conflicts: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx-ia32
Replaces: nvidia-glx-src
Description: NVIDIA binary XFree86 4.x / Xorg driver (legacy version)
 These XFree86 4.0 binary drivers provide optimized hardware acceleration of
 OpenGL applications via a direct-rendering X Server. AGP, TV-out and
 flat panel displays are also supported.
 .
 Please see the nvidia-kernel-legacy-source package for building the kernel 
 module required by this package.

Package: nvidia-glx-legacy
Architecture: i386 amd64
Depends: nvidia-kernel-legacy-#VERSION#, x11-common, ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: nvidia-settings, nvidia-kernel-legacy-source (>= #VERSION#)
Provides: xserver-xorg-video
Conflicts: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx
Replaces: nvidia-glx-src
Description: NVIDIA binary XFree86 4.x driver (legacy version)
 These XFree86 4.0 / Xorg  binary drivers provide optimized hardware 
 acceleration of  OpenGL applications via a direct-rendering X Server. 
 AGP, PCIe, SLI, TV-out and flat panel displays are also supported.
 .
 Please see the nvidia-kernel-legacy-source package for building the kernel 
 module required by this package.
 
Package: nvidia-glx-legacy-dev
Architecture: i386 amd64
Conflicts: nvidia-glx-dev
Depends: nvidia-glx-legacy (>= #VERSION#), xlibmesa-gl-dev | libgl-dev
Description: NVIDIA binary XFree86 4.x driver development files
 This package contains the NVIDIA binary XFree86 4.x / Xorg driver
 development files.
 .
 For more information on this source package visit NVIDIA's homepage
 at http://www.nvidia.com/ .

Package: nvidia-kernel-legacy-source
Architecture: i386 amd64
Depends: debhelper (>> 4.0.0), make, sed (>> 3.0), dpatch (>= 2.0.0)
Recommends: nvidia-glx-legacy (>= #VERSION#), kernel-package (>= 8.082), devscripts
Conflicts: nvidia-kernel-src
Replaces: nvidia-kernel-src
Description: NVIDIA binary kernel module source (legacy version)
 This package builds the NVIDIA XFree86 4.x / Xorg  binary kernel module 
 needed  by nvidia-glx. The drivers provide optimized hardware acceleration 
 of OpenGL applications via a direct-rendering X Server AGP,
 PCIe, SLI, TV-out, and flat panel displays are also supported.
 .
 PLEASE read /usr/share/doc/nvidia-kernel-legacy-source/README.Debian for 
 building information.
 .
